{"e2249870-322e-461f-9704-249d49d8fa89":{"id":"e2249870-322e-461f-9704-249d49d8fa89","title":"Ushiro no Seki no Gyaru ni Sukarete Shimatta. - Mou Ore wa Dame Kamoshiranai.","altTitle":"The Gal is Sitting Behind Me, and Loves Me.","description":"What if you found the cutest girl in your class, soaked from falling in a ditch? Sandai helped her... and his life changed from that day!\n\nSandai, a high-school boy who liked to spend his time alone, helped the most beautiful girl in his class, Shino, when she fell into a ditch near his home. He let her use the shower at his home, and lent her some clothes, although he had never talked with her before.\n\nFrom that day, she started to act like his friend. In fact, she seems to like him... but that can't be! She's the most popular girl in his high school! But what he didn't know was, Shino had never gone out with a guy. She was not very good with guys, and Sandai was the first guy she could talk naturally with. As they spend time together, Sandai can't help but develop special feelings for Shino.\n\n*Source: BookWalker Global*","year":2023,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/e2249870-322e-461f-9704-249d49d8fa89/268289ef-0b4c-4464-afe0-4d436c9c5c0d.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en","id","pt-br","vi","es-la"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.75,"follows":96096,"listAt":"2026-10-19T10:05:14.358Z","chapters":[{"id":"01d09d90-967b-49bc-ab7a-5189e3f0056c","number":"29","volume":"5","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":22,"createdAt":"2026-10-09T00:13:45+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"07617993-f531-4c30-8f66-7e04db7de597","number":"28","volume":"5","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":20,"createdAt":"2026-08-31T16:41:54+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"4685cb1d-c453-4fe1-b99c-bf16612018a8","number":"27","volume":"4","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":28,"createdAt":"2026-06-06T15:15:47+00:00","baked":false