ep getting promoted?! His original goal was simply a peaceful life, yet somehow, his second life is racing down the path of the Heavenly Demon. Will he ever be able to find the life he truly desires in this world?\n\n(Source: MangaUpdates)","year":2025,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Comedy","Adventure","Isekai","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/fefc3c7e-6737-450f-8190-13472aeb54ee/9d89d61b-ad36-4c49-b05f-2403e14caf4e.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["id","pt-br"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.08,"follows":325,"listAt":"2026-10-19T19:04:28.555Z","chapters":[{"id":"c7ae9a35-be19-4d41-aac4-39f2471d663c","number":"2","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":27,"createdAt":"2025-09-10T08:27:50+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"40ded63b-aab4-40f1-a479-cbd5bbba6774","number":"1","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"id","pages":39,"createdAt":"2025-09-05T10:49:31+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":2,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:32:05.374Z"}}
